Third-party components

These are not MIT, and they are not the fan-art files above. They keep their
own notices:

- themes/plasma/styles/aura-soulflame/ is a recolor of the Daemon style. Its
  metadata License field stays LGPL, and the bundled GPL text stays with the
  style.
- The folder and status icons in themes/plasma/icons/AuraSoulflame/ are
  recolored Breeze icons and stay under the bundled LGPL notice. Only the
  launcher PNGs listed above are fan art.
